==Notes==

* The number of companion abilities used is '''not''' tracked with a buff icon on the UI, however a buff icon '''is''' shown when a free ability is ready.
** Only one free ability use can be stored at a time.
** Companion ability counter is '''not''' reset on companion death.
* Other miscellaneous mods that '''do not''' trigger the effect include:
** '''All Companions''': [[Bond Mods]], {{M|Synth Deconstruct}}, {{M|Synth Fiber}}
** '''Beast Companions''': {{M|Hunter Command}}, {{M|Scavenge}}
** '''Kavats''': {{M|Swipe}}, {{M|Tek Assault}} 
** '''Robotic''': {{M|Odomedic}}, {{M|Self Destruct}}

==Bugs==

==Patch History==
{{Scrollbox/Article|
{{ver|43.0.7}}
*Fixed a script error related to Mystic Bond.

{{ver|38}}
*Fixed Mystic Bond not triggering when equipped on a Client’s Panzer Vulpaphyla (using Viral Quills.)

{{ver|37.0.1}}
*Fixed Companions standing still and not using their abilities if any of the Bond Mods are equipped.

{{ver|35}}
*Fixed subsequent casts of Xaku's The Lost and The Vast Untime Abilities not consuming Mystic Bond charges, allowing them to be cast for free repeatedly.

{{ver|34.0.5}}
*Fixed Viral Quills quill launch ability not triggering Mystic Bond’s “Companion uses Abilities with cooldowns 5 times” condition.

{{ver|34.0.4}}
*Fixed Mystic Bond’s chance at a free Warframe ability cast triggering every 5 seconds instead of the intended “after Companion uses abilities with cooldowns 5 times” when equipped with the Strain Mod on a Helminth Charger.

{{ver|34.0.2}}
*Fixed case where Hounds would not attack or move if they had any of the new Bond Mods equipped.
*Fixed getting some small one-time Affinity popups when first loading into a mission with certain Bond Mods equipped.

{{ver|34.0.1}}
*Fixed several script errors with the new Bond Mods while Null Audit is also equipped.

{{ver|34}}
*Introduced.
